      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a draft for a paper about that new novel *The Glass Horizon*. I want to focus my opening on how the author uses the protagonist to effectively deconstruct the narrow-mindedness and intellectual rigidity of the opposing political faction in the book. Can you help me draft a few opening paragraphs that establish this theme?",
